          "name": "What is performance marketing and how does it differ from traditional digital marketing?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Performance marketing is a comprehensive, results-driven digital advertising strategy where you only pay for tangible actions such as verified leads, completed sales, clicks, or app installs. Unlike traditional digital marketing that focuses primarily on brand awareness or vanity impressions, performance marketing is 100% focused on quantifiable metrics like Return on Ad Spend (ROAS), Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC), and bottom-line revenue."
